          <span>How fathers pursue and protect custody</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/guardianship-vs-custody-uae/" class="service-link">
          <strong>Guardianship vs Custody</strong>
          <span>Wilayah and hadanah explained</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/child-custody-uae/" class="service-link">
          <strong>Child Custody UAE</strong>
          <span>Custody to 18 and the choice age of 15</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/talaq-uae/" class="service-link">
          <strong>Talaq in the UAE</strong>
          <span>Court documentation and the single-count rule</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/khula-divorce-uae/" class="service-link">
          <strong>Khula Divorce</strong>
          <span>Wife-initiated divorce and mahr return</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/mahr-divorce-uae/" class="service-link">
          <strong>Mahr and Divorce</strong>
          <span>Prompt and deferred dowry on divorce</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/alimony-uae/" class="service-link">
          <strong>Alimony UAE</strong>
          <span>How spousal maintenance is calculated</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/child-support-uae/" class="service-link">
          <strong>Child Support UAE</strong>
          <span>The father duty regardless of custody</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <FAQSection items={faqItems} lang="en" />

    <section class="section section--cta" aria-labelledby="bottom-cta-heading" id="contact">
      <h2 id="bottom-cta-heading">Understand Your Rights as a Husband: Free Consultation</h2>
      <p>Speak to a qualified UAE family lawyer within 24 hours. Completely confidential. English and Arabic support.</p>
      <LeadForm lang="en" variant="inline" />
    </section>

  </main>

